+DUMP: auipc a0,
+DUMP-NEXT: addi a0, a0,
+DUMP-LABEL: <get_cli>:
+DUMP: c.li a0, 31
+DUMP-LABEL: <get_addi>:
+DUMP: addi a0, zero, 100
